training pipeline for stem custom separator

1. upload your music to the cloud box
2. run batch separation to create training data:
   python3 batch_separate.py /path/to/music /path/to/stems
3. train:
   python3 train.py --data /path/to/stems --size small --epochs 200
4. test it:
   python3 inference.py checkpoints/best.pt song.wav output/
5. download best.pt to your machine (~50MB)

model sizes:
  tiny   ~3M params   fastest, rougher quality
  small  ~8M params   good balance
  medium ~15M params  best quality, slower

to use in stem, replace fast_separate.py with inference.py
